  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Antigravity System — Innate Technique (11th level)</em></p><p>At 11th level, you master all aspects of your technique and gain the following improvements to your <em>Antigravity</em>:<br />\n<strong>Lasting Field</strong>. You can spend additional CE up to your modifier to increase the range by 10 feet and the duration by 1 round per CE.<br />\n<strong>Sweeping Gravity</strong>. Creatures with a Dexterity score below your CE save DC cannot make a Dexterity saving throw against your technique.<br />\n<strong>Nauseating Gravity</strong>. If a creature fails a saving throw against your <em>Disorienting Gravity</em>, they are also stunned until the end of their next turn.<br />\n<strong>Hard Fall</strong>. Fall damage from your field becomes d12 bludgeoning.</p>",
